[00:03.305]People always ask where do you see yourself in 5 years
{"人们总爱问五年后你会在哪里"}
[00:09.147]But I don't know, I don't know where I'll be in a week
{"但我不知道 连下周身在何处都难预料"}
[00:15.454]Maybe moving to the city out of reach, just staying right here
{"或许会搬去遥不可及的都市 也可能原地停留"}
[00:21.259]But I don't know, I don't know, we'll just have to see
{"但我不知道 不知道 只能静待分晓"}
[00:27.177]I can't guess tomorrow life is out of our control
{"我无法预知明天 人生本就不由我们掌控"}
[00:33.073]I'm holding on to you but the rest I'm letting go
{"我只紧握着你 其余一切皆可放手"}
[00:38.612]Baby, in 5 years, we could be dead broke
{"亲爱的 五年后我们可能穷困潦倒"}
[00:41.641]We could be living like we're kings
{"也可能活得如同君王"}
[00:44.566]Maybe in 5 years, we could be hopeless
